# Third-party material in adk-cost-correctness

The suite's own code, tests, case definitions and documentation are Apache-2.0 (`LICENSE`).
This file lists everything in the repository that is not the author's own, what licence or status it has,
whether attribution is required, and where the notice sits. It was written 2026-10-08 from the repository
at commit `dfa3730` plus the licence metadata read from PyPI and GitHub that day (commands in the last
section). It is a good-faith inventory, not legal advice.

